# ==============================================================================
# AI SITE STUDIO — CLINE AGENT RULES (.clinerules)
# Scope: repository development only; do not inject these rules into end-user website-generation prompts.
# Generated websites must follow the user's brief and active generation contract, without forced backend, database, pages, images, or features.
# Architecture: 8-Stage Specialized AI Agents Swarm
# Engines: Cline Autonomous Engine (qwen3-coder:30b, qwen3-coder:latest, qwen2.5-coder:latest) + Ollama
# ==============================================================================

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 1. CORE ARCHITECTURAL DIRECTIVES & ROLE
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
You are acting as a Senior AI Architect, Senior AI Engineer, and Lead Full-Stack Developer for AI Site Studio.
When generating, refactoring, or auditing code:
1. NEVER output truncated placeholders (e.g. `// TODO: add remaining items`, `...rest of code`).
2. Always write 100% complete, runnable, production-ready code.
3. Keep tokens optimized by making targeted line edits rather than rewriting large unaffected files.

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 2. 8-STAGE SPECIALIZED AI AGENTS SWARM PROTOCOL
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
All template synthesis and code generation must strictly comply with the 8-stage swarm pipeline:
- [1/8] Planning Agent: Business domain, value proposition, and ordered pages list.
- [2/8] UI Designer Agent: Design tokens, primary/secondary/accent hex palette, Google Fonts pairing.
- [3/8] Frontend Developer Agent: Multi-page high-fidelity React (or Vue/HTML5) UI components.
- [4/8] Backend Developer Agent: Dedicated standalone FastAPI/Express REST API (`main.py` with CORS).
- [5/8] Database Architect Agent: SQLite table schemas and realistic `seed.py` data.
- [6/8] SEO & Accessibility Agent: Dynamic meta tags, OpenGraph, Twitter cards, and Schema.org JSON-LD.
- [7/8] Testing & Audit Agent: Automated syntax validation and ZIP tech stack audit.
- [8/8] Deployment Agent: Packaging into `frontend/`, `backend/`, and `README.md` archive.

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 3. CLINE AUTONOMOUS ENGINE & MODEL ROUTING CONFIGURATION
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
- Local Engine: Ollama OpenAI-compatible endpoint at `http://localhost:11434/v1`.
- Primary Coding & Architecture Engine: Cline Engine (`qwen2.5-coder:latest`, `qwen3.5:9b`, `qwen2.5-coder:7b`).
- Planning & Project Breakdown: Cline Engine (`qwen3.5:9b`, `qwen2.5-coder:latest`).
- Designer & UI Tokens: Cline Engine (`qwen3.5:9b`, `qwen2.5-coder:latest`, strict JSON compliance).
- SEO & Structured Data: Cline Engine (`qwen3.5:9b`, `qwen2.5-coder:latest`, Schema.org JSON-LD, OpenGraph).
- External Cloud Dependencies: None. Google Gemini is disabled. 100% Local & Free Execution.

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 4. TEMPLATE QUALITY & FULL-STACK RULES (ZERO FAILS)
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
1. COMPLETE PAGE DELIVERY (ZERO MISSING PAGES):
   - Every page referenced in navigation, drawers, or footers (`index.html`, `about.html`, `services.html`, `contact.html`, `portfolio.html`, etc.) MUST physically exist and contain rich, domain-authentic content.
2. 100% WORKING RELATIVE LINKS:
   - Navigation links and CTA buttons must link directly to target pages (`href="services.html"`). Never use broken anchor `#` tags.
   - The active navigation tab must have a visual glow or active border.
3. COMPLETE STANDALONE BACKEND INTEGRATION:
   - Always include a working standalone REST API (`backend/main.py`) with:
     * CORS middleware enabled (`allow_origins=["*"]`).
     * `GET /api/health` -> `{"status": "ok"}`
     * `POST /api/contact` -> accepts `name`, `email`, `message`, saves to SQLite `app.db`.
     * `POST /api/newsletter` -> email subscription handler.
4. RICH REAL-WORLD PHOTOGRAPHY:
   - Use high-resolution Unsplash CDN URLs (`https://images.unsplash.com/photo-...`). Never leave `src=""` empty or use broken placeholders.

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 5. FRONTEND & REPOSITORY CONVENTIONS
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
1. REACT ROUTER v8 IMPORT RULE:
   - ALWAYS import React Router hooks and components from `"react-router-dom"`:
     `import { useNavigate, useLocation, Link } from "react-router-dom";`
   - Never import from `"react-router"` directly, as Vite is aliased to `"react-router-dom"`.
2. PATHS:
   - Frontend pages live in `frontend/src/app/<route>/page.jsx`.
   - Backend routes live in `backend/app/api/v1/routes/`.
   - Python virtual environment is located at `backend/.venv/Scripts/python.exe`.
